  "name": "antsim-overload",

  "_what": "The project's name, spelled in solid terrain in the",
  "_what2": "same 3x5 font the HUD draws with. The nest sits below",
  "_what3": "the word and the food above it, so every trail has to",
  "_what4": "thread the lettering. Generated from the font itself by",
  "_what5": "scripts/build-word-scenario.lisp -- do not hand-edit.",
  "_why1": "1400 ants on 40 units of stock: metabolism exceeds income",
  "_why2": "from the first tick, so the only question left is how the",
  "_why3": "nest shares what little arrives.  At nest_meals_per_tick 0",
  "_why4": "-- the old communal sip -- it stabilises, then from about",
  "_why5": "T2800 oscillates at stock 0 with an exhausted nest, and",
  "_why6": "never recovers.  With meals it does.  Reported from the",
  "_why7": "window; the seed is the one it was seen on.",

